codex
The first context-sensitivity probe exposed an expected modeling detail rather than the targeted issue: leaving allocator/control cells symbolic made the base semantics branch and stick during the shadow `ord` call. I have grounded every omitted cell so the witness now compares two fully realizable configurations; the proof-local summary itself requires none of those cells, so this strengthens the test.
